Subject: Select original PreInitFS memory callback

Upstream-base: 9ca59d250587adc0436d08176bec3898aa790fa0

Select original PreInitFS memory callback
Extract the original callback and global resource requirements without changing
their budgets, order or texture capacity. The full entry includes the extraction;
the native memory target selects it independently and exports a typed wrapper.
Use an explicit exception rather than a console break if native initialization
returns failure. This does not select glStartup's material/platform/state/view/
target/font stages or any game task. Never compile both entry units together.

diff --git a/include/Game/GraphicsMemoryStartup.h b/include/Game/GraphicsMemoryStartup.h
new file mode 100644
